          "title": "A Decap orchestrion with Walter Hus and BELEM",
          "intro": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Composer Walter Hus plays a mechanical orchestra of Decap instruments: transportable pipe units, a percussion unit and an accordion, built around 2017. With BELEM, the duo of accordionist Didier Laloy and cellist Kathy Adam, it became The Mekanics.",
